{
  "description": "The creature is a single quadrupedal equine shown in right-facing side profile against a plain light background. It has a compact, sturdy body covered in short brown to gray-brown fur that is darker along the back and neck and paler cream-white on the muzzle, lower belly and inner legs. The head is elongated with a blunt muzzle, the neck is thick and muscular, the torso is barrel-shaped, and the four slender legs support the body with small shadows cast on the ground beneath the hooves. The overall form, proportions, coat texture and details are those of a donkey rendered in a highly detailed naturalistic style.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "elongated and blocky with a blunt muzzle, brown fur with a distinct white-cream patch covering the nose and mouth area, a dark eye with a light ring around it, visible nostril on the side, and wrinkled skin around the mouth and cheek",
      "where": "at the front end of the body, attached to the neck and facing to the right"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two large, upright, pointed ears with brown outer fur, paler inner fur and dark shading inside the ear canal, with slightly tufted tips",
      "where": "on top of the head, one slightly forward and one slightly back, standing erect"
    },
    {
      "part": "mane",
      "looks_like": "short, stiff, bristly hair forming a dark brown to black crest of upright tufts",
      "where": "running along the dorsal midline of the neck from just behind the ears to the shoulders"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four slender, straight legs with brown outer fur and lighter gray-cream inner surfaces, with visible knee and hock joints, tendons and slight wrinkling of skin",
      "where": "beneath the torso, two forelegs under the chest and two hind legs under the hips, supporting the body in a standing posture"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four rounded, solid hooves, dark gray-brown with textured, slightly worn surfaces and a flat base",
      "where": "at the distal tip of each leg, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "thin tail with short hair at the base and a longer tuft of straight dark brown hair hanging down",
      "where": "at the posterior end of the body, extending down from the rump"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "paler cream-white fur on the muzzle, around the eye, on the ventral belly, chest and inner legs, contrasting with the darker brown-gray dorsal coat and a darker stripe along the back",
      "where": "on the face, underside of the body and inner surfaces of the legs"
    }
  ],
